Configure_Budgets_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when a call into Budgets is already running
│   └── it should revert with ReentrantCall
├── when the Roles modifier's avatar is not the caller
│   └── it should revert with InvalidConfiguration
├── when the Roles modifier's target is not a Signer Gate whose safe is the caller
│   └── it should revert with InvalidConfiguration
├── when the Roles modifier's target is the caller itself
│   └── it should revert with InvalidConfiguration
├── when a read of the avatar or the target or the Gate's safe reverts or returns malformed data
│   └── it should revert with InvalidConfiguration
└── when the avatar is the caller and the target is the caller's Signer Gate
    ├── it should store the Roles address and the payout role key for the caller
    ├── given the Safe was configured before
    │   └── it should replace the old configuration
    └── it should emit Configured
